# The Wintun release Caelo is built and tested against.
#
# Pinned rather than "latest" because this is a kernel driver that creates the
# adapter carrying somebody's whole machine, fetched over the network at build
# time. A version and a hash make the build reproducible and make a substituted
# download a failure rather than a surprise. WireGuard's own installer does the
# same thing in its Makefile, and Tailscale keeps the same three values in Go.
#
# The DLL is not free software and is not in this repository. See
# core/ATTRIBUTION.md for the licence it arrives under and why shipping it
# alongside Caelo is aggregation rather than combination.
